 "Our degree programme is great; the livestock department in particular gave us a wide range of knowledge with practicals. It would be good to improve the degree with the latest subjects and to update the subject content. More connections with industry would be great, as would research opportunities and sessions on academic careers. For example, on our farm we water outdoor plants with watering cans, but right after graduating we had to look up how to install a drip irrigation system in a poly tunnel. Nevertheless, this is a great degree with great lecturers.",
